{"event": "file_read", "time": 1793185438.0347152, "run_id": "eb67a89eef094083a110b35b721389a3", "seq": 1, "path": "/mnt/d/Muiti-Agent Programing/materials/long-context/公开任务/题目2/task.md", "content": "# 题目2：阅读真实源码，完成跨模块日志配置（1分）\n\n使用你在上次实践基础上扩展的 agent，为 DeepInfer 增加一个小功能：**通过环境变量限制普通诊断日志的消息长度，同时让统计日志保持完整**。需要在配置、日志格式化、统计消息消费三个模块间接好这条链路，不要求部署整个推理框架。\n\n本题使用固定提交 `774ce244b87cc0eb8d4b94ab9f5de2ab22049f01` 的完整官方源码，来源见 [材料说明](来源与许可.md)。长上下文来自真实代码仓库：agent 需要检索不同文件、保留相关代码的含义，并据此完成跨文件修改。不是读到一个函数后单独改它，也不要求通读整个仓库或发送所有无关代码。\n\n## 功能目标与例子\n\n**环境变量**是进程启动时可以读取的字符串配置。**日志处理器（handler）**是终端、文件等输出渠道；**格式化器（formatter）**负责把日志记录转成文字。同一条 **LogRecord（日志记录对象）**可以交给多个处理器。\n\n新增环境变量 `DEEPINFER_LOG_MAX_MESSAGE_CHARS`。例如将它设为 `64` 后，默认处理器输出的普通诊断消息最多保留64字符；统计模块从队列输出的完整指标不受这个限制。未设置变量时，输出保持原样。\n\n这是业务源码中的配置，不是给自己的 agent 新增命令行参数，也不是模型 API 的 token 上限。课程测试会自行设置它，运行评测命令前不必手动设置。\n\n### 1. 配置读取与刷新\n\n在 `deepinfer/environ.py` 的集中配置中加入同名属性，遵循现有配置描述符的读取和缓存机制。**描述符**是控制属性读取行为的对象；这里首次访问配置时读取环境变量，之后使用缓存。\n\n- 未设置时，属性值为 `None`，表示不限长。\n- 设置时，按 Python 的 `int` 解析，结果须大于等于32。空串、不能解析的字符串或小于32的值抛出 `ValueError`；错误文字须包含变量名，便于定位。\n- 第一次访问后保持缓存。只修改系统环境变量，不应立即改变已有配置值。\n- 使用原有的单项刷新或全部刷新机制后，下次读取才重新解析。重新执行默认日志初始化时，将当时的配置值应用到新的格式化器；已创建的旧格式化器保留原预算。\n\n例如先读取 `32`，再把环境变量改成 `64`，重新初始化日志仍使用缓存的32；先刷新这项配置、再重新初始化日志，才改为64。无需让运行中的所有处理器自动刷新。\n\n### 2. 普通日志的长度预算\n\n在 `deepinfer/logger.py` 中扩展 `NewLineFormatter`，并让默认日志初始化读取上述配置。\n\n1. 保留原有四个位置参数，新参数 `max_message_chars` 只能按名称传入。默认 `None` 表示不限长；其他值须为大于等于32的整数，布尔值不算整数，否则抛出 `ValueError`。\n2. 先完成 `%s` 等参数替换，再计算消息长度。预算只限制消息正文，不包含时间、级别等前缀、异常回溯或 `stack_info`（调用栈文字）。\n3. 用 Python 的 `len` 和字符串切片计数。中文、表情、换行也计数；不要求保护组合字符或整个表情序列。\n4. 消息不超过预算时保持原样。超出时，用固定标记 `...<omitted>...` 替换中间内容，标记计入预算。剩余空间为“预算减去标记长度”，开头保留向上取整的一半，末尾保留其余部分，拼成“开头、标记、末尾”。例如预算32时，保留开头9字符、末尾8字符，加上15字符标记。\n5. 沿用原有多行前缀、时间精度、颜色及异常处理。不能改写共享原记录的 `msg`、`args`、`exc_info`、`stack_info`；同一记录随后交给完整处理器，仍须保留完整消息。\n6. 默认处理器使用集中配置；重复初始化不能重复添加处理器。独立创建格式化器时，未传新参数仍表示不限长，不自行读取环境变量。\n7. 如果记录的 `keep_full_message` 属性**恰好是 `True`**，完整保留消息；`1`、字符串等其他值不能代替 `True`。\n\n### 3. 统计日志的完整输出\n\n在 `deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py` 中找到真正消费日志队列并输出消息的位置。通过 Python logging 的 `extra` 字段，为每条统计消息附加 `keep_full_message=True`，让默认处理器保留其完整内容。\n\n`extra` 用于给当前日志记录添加属性，不是给整份日志模块关闭预算。普通诊断日志仍须限长。保留原来的消息队列、批量消息顺序、结束信号、等待和异常处理，不要直接打印消息、清空队列或重写统计计算。\n\n## 阅读与上下文要求\n\n允许修改的三个文件如下。表中按职责给出阅读范围；具体函数位置由 agent 自己检索。\n\n| 文件 | 首次修改前需要读入模型的原始代码 | 为什么需要 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `deepinfer/environ.py` | 完整配置描述符类，以及单项刷新、全部刷新函数 | 确认首次读取、缓存、错误包装和刷新怎样协作；新配置不能绕开原机制 |\n| `deepinfer/logger.py` | 完整格式化器类、默认日志初始化函数、获取日志对象的函数 | 确认预算如何接入真实输出，且不影响旧接口、其他处理器及异常信息 |\n| `deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py` | 日志模块的导入和日志对象初始化，以及完整队列投递、消费函数 | 确认统计消息经过哪条路径输出，找到应添加记录属性的位置 |\n\n三个文件全文合计约3.4万字符，仓库中还有其他源码；相关片段通常更短。评测**不按阅读字数或请求次数多少加分**，也不要求一定分多次调用模型。关键是能从较长代码中找到必要信息，修改时仍能利用它，并让三个模块共同工作。模型收到源码不等于已经理解，最终还要通过功能测试。\n\n第一次写入前，先用自己的文件工具完整读取三个初始文件，**每个文件各保存一条完整的 `file_read` 记录，`content` 为该文件全文**，供补丁和过程核对；只记录片段不能替代这条初始记录。**不要求把全文同时发给模型**，上表所需代码可以分块进入不同请求。产生首次修改决定的请求，要保留这些原文，或复用模型依据它们生成的笔记。只把原文写入日志、没有实际送入模型，不能通过阅读检查。\n\n分块时以表中要求的完整类、完整函数或独立调用为单位：每个单位须在一次请求中完整发送，不同单位可以分到不同请求。这样既能控制上下文大小，也能让模型看到一个机制的完整实现。\n\n可以直接保留原文，不新增笔记事件。若用笔记替换原文，记录以下可选事件，并在后续修改请求中复用模型实际返回的文字：\n\n```json\n{\"event\":\"context_note\",\"sources\":[\"deepinfer/environ.py\",\"deepinfer/logger.py\"],\"content\":\"这里记录模型依据已收到的真实源码返回的笔记，之后在修改请求中复用\"}\n```\n\n`sources` 为来源路径数组，`content` 为20～3000字符；可以一份跨文件笔记，也可多份。先让模型阅读对应原文并生成笔记，再记录、复用，不能在修改决定之后补记。细节见 [日志规范](../../说明/日志与产物规范.md)。\n\n### 可选的源码读取工具\n\n可继续使用自己的分段读取工具，也可让 agent 在本轮工作副本根目录调用 `read_source.py`：\n\n```bash\n# 搜索配置相关代码；返回匹配行前最多3行及后续原文\npython read_source.py --file deepinfer/environ.py --search \"Logging\" --lines 15\n\n# 定位某类日志调用，再按需要补读周围的完整函数\npython read_source.py --file deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py --search \"logger.info\" --lines 15\n\n# 已找到位置时按行读取；行号从1起算\npython read_source.py --file deepinfer/logger.py --start-line 1 --lines 100\n```\n\n| 参数 | 含义 |\n|---|---|\n| `--file` | 必填，工作副本内的相对文件路径，不填其他目录或绝对路径 |\n| `--search` | 可选，原样、区分大小写搜索，最多返回前5处匹配；与 `--start-line` 不能同时使用 |\n| `--start-line` | 可选，包含起始行；未提供搜索和行号时从第1行开始 |\n| `--lines` | 每段最多返回的行数，默认40，允许1～120，不超过文件末尾 |\n\n成功返回 JSON：`path` 为实际路径，`total_lines` 为总行数，`ranges` 中每项包含 `start_line`、`end_line` 和原始 `content`。搜索还返回 `total_matches` 和 `more_matches`；未找到时 `ranges` 为空。结果超过12,000字符时退出2，请减少行数或缩小关键词。\n\n工具只读源码，不总结、不改代码、不调用模型。使用时在 `command_result` 中保留实际参数数组、工作目录、退出码和完整 JSON。其他命令的检索结果可保留，但用作阅读证据的代码须另以 `file_read` 记录原文。\n\n## 修改范围与开发记录\n\n只修改上表三个文件，三个文件都要有实际修改：配置模块新增配置项，可增加必要标准库辅助函数，但保留原配置项、描述符类已有成员和刷新函数；描述符类可以新增辅助工厂方法（用于创建配置项的方法）；日志模块只扩展格式化器和默认初始化，可增加必要标准库导入或辅助函数；统计模块只调整现有队列消费函数内部的日志调用，保留其他原有节点。\n\n不修改其他业务文件、依赖、课程工具、`pytest.ini` 或 `.course/`。可以在自己的 agent 中增加局部替换或补丁工具，避免让模型重写整份长文件；每次实际写入后，`file_write.content` 仍须记录该文件写入后的完整内容。不要把预先写好的正确补丁放进 agent。\n\nagent 须在首次修改前、最后修改后各执行一次完整 `python -m pytest -q`。初始版本缺少新功能，初测失败正常；后测必须全部通过。在启动目录生成 `run.log` 和包含三个文件的完整 `patch.diff`，格式见日志规范。无需新增 agent 启动参数。\n\n## 自测与得分\n\n按 [README 的题目2步骤](../../README.md#3-自测题目2)准备初始工作区、运行 `eval_deepinfer.py`。本题最多20次真实请求，单次完整请求体不超过32,000字符，默认限时1800秒。预算包括题面、历史、源码、笔记和工具定义，不只算本次新增文字。\n\n程序独立核对开发过程、源码阅读与复用、修改范围和三文件补丁，再运行兼容测试及跨模块集成检查。集成检查实际加载工作副本的配置、日志模块，并执行从统计源码原样提取的队列消费函数；只将分布式 rank 查询隔离为本地0，不加载GPU依赖，不替代被修改的业务逻辑。这验证课程要求的日志链路，不代表验证完整推理产品。\n\n**所有条件通过得1分，否则得0分，不按通过的测试数量折算。** API或验证进程异常而未完成时显示“未完成”，不直接判0分。先看终端结论，再看 `result.json`；阅读问题看 `源码阅读检查.json`，功能问题看 `regression.log`、`runtime.json` 和 `runtime.log`。\n\n修改后的三份源码保存在 `modified-source/`，补丁为 `deepinfer.patch`。题目3重新完成的也是这个跨模块任务，须先用当前版本通过题目2。\n"}
{"event": "snapshot", "time": 1793185438.0682468, "run_id": "eb67a89eef094083a110b35b721389a3", "seq": 2, "path": "deepinfer/logger.py", "content": "# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\n# Derived from vLLM; modified by DeepSeek.\n\n# Adapted from\n# https://github.com/skypilot-org/skypilot/blob/86dc0f6283a335e4aa37b3c10716f90999f48ab6/sky/sky_logging.py\n\"\"\"Logging configuration for DeepInfer.\"\"\"\n\nimport datetime\nimport logging\nimport multiprocessing\nimport os\nimport sys\nimport threading\nimport time\nfrom multiprocessing.context import ForkProcess, SpawnProcess\nfrom multiprocessing.process import BaseProcess\nfrom types import TracebackType\n\n_FORMAT = \"[%(levelname)s %(asctime)s %(filename)s:%(lineno)d] %(message)s\"\n_DATE_FORMAT = \"%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"\n\n# ANSI 颜色（仅在 TTY 输出时使用），按日志级别区分\n_LEVEL_COLORS = {\n    logging.DEBUG: \"\\033[36m\",  # cyan\n    logging.INFO: \"\\033[32m\",  # green\n    logging.WARNING: \"\\033[33m\",  # yellow\n    logging.ERROR: \"\\033[31m\",  # red\n    logging.CRITICAL: \"\\033[1;31m\",  # bold red\n}\n_COLOR_RESET = \"\\033[0m\"\n\n\nclass NewLineFormatter(logging.Formatter):\n    \"\"\"Adds logging prefix to newlines to align multi-line messages, optionally with microsecond precision.\n\n    若 use_color=True 且输出为 TTY，会给日志级别染色（不影响写入文件的纯净度）。\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(\n        self,\n        fmt: str,\n        datefmt: str | None = None,\n        high_precision: bool = False,\n        use_color: bool = False,\n    ) -> None:\n        super().__init__(fmt, datefmt)\n        self.high_precision = high_precision\n        self.use_color = use_color\n\n    def formatTime(self, record: logging.LogRecord, datefmt: str | None = None) -> str:\n        if not self.high_precision:\n            # 调用 logging.Formatter 默认实现，保持原来的格式\n            return super().formatTime(record, datefmt)\n        # ===== 高精度模式：在普通 datefmt 基础上附加微秒 =====\n        base = time.strftime(datefmt or _DATE_FORMAT, self.converter(record.created))\n        return f\"{base}.{record.msecs * 1000:06.0f}\"\n\n    def format(self, record: logging.LogRecord) -> str:\n        msg = super().format(record)\n        # 快速路径：单行日志（绝大多数情况）无需做对齐处理\n        if \"\\n\" in msg and record.message:\n            prefix = msg[: msg.find(record.message)]\n            msg = msg.replace(\"\\n\", \"\\n\" + prefix)\n        if self.use_color:\n            color = _LEVEL_COLORS.get(record.levelno)\n            if color:\n                msg = f\"{color}{msg}{_COLOR_RESET}\"\n        return msg\n\n\n_root_logger = logging.getLogger(\"deepinfer\")\n_default_handler = None\n\n\ndef _setup_logger() -> None:\n    global _default_handler\n    _root_logger.setLevel(logging.DEBUG)\n    if _default_handler is None:\n        _default_handler = logging.StreamHandler(sys.stdout)\n        _default_handler.flush = sys.stdout.flush\n        _default_handler.setLevel(logging.INFO)\n        _root_logger.addHandler(_default_handler)\n\n    fmt = NewLineFormatter(\n        _FORMAT,\n        datefmt=_DATE_FORMAT,\n        use_color=sys.stdout.isatty(),\n    )\n    _default_handler.setFormatter(fmt)\n    _root_logger.propagate = False\n\n\n_setup_logger()\n\n\ndef init_logger(name: str) -> logging.Logger:\n    logger = logging.getLogger(name)\n    logger.setLevel(logging.DEBUG)\n    # name 在 \"deepinfer\" 层级下时，通过 propagate 冒泡复用 root logger 的 handler，\n    # 无需自己挂 handler。否则回退到直接挂 handler（避免重复添加）。\n    if name == \"deepinfer\" or name.startswith(\"deepinfer.\"):\n        logger.propagate = True\n    else:\n        logger.propagate = False\n        if _default_handler is not None and _default_handler not in logger.handlers:\n            logger.addHandler(_default_handler)\n    return logger\n\n\ndef _print_error_line(message: str) -> None:\n    now = datetime.datetime.now().strftime(f\"{_DATE_FORMAT}.%f\")\n    print(f\"[ERROR {now}] {message}\", file=sys.stderr, flush=True)\n\n\ndef print_crash_header() -> None:\n    process_name = multiprocessing.current_process().name\n    thread_name = threading.current_thread().name\n    _print_error_line(f\"Uncaught exception in process {process_name} thread {thread_name} (pid {os.getpid()}):\")\n\n\ndef install_excepthook(exit_on_thread_exception: bool = False) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Print error timestamp, traceback, and process/thread info when an uncaught exception occurs.\n\n    Args:\n        exit_on_thread_exception (bool): If True, the process will exit when an uncaught exception occurs in a thread.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _excepthook(\n        exc_type: type[BaseException],\n        exc_value: BaseException,\n        exc_tb: TracebackType | None,\n    ) -> None:\n        print_crash_header()\n        sys.__excepthook__(exc_type, exc_value, exc_tb)\n\n    def _thread_excepthook(args: threading.ExceptHookArgs) -> None:\n        print_crash_header()\n        threading.__excepthook__(args)\n        if exit_on_thread_exception:\n            _print_error_line(f\"Aborting process due to uncaught exception in thread {args.thread.name}: {args.exc_value}\")\n            sys.stdout.flush()\n            sys.stderr.flush()\n            os._exit(1)\n\n    sys.excepthook = _excepthook\n    threading.excepthook = _thread_excepthook\n\n\nclass _CrashHeaderProcessMixin(BaseProcess):\n    \"\"\"给子进程崩溃打印头信息，每条路径恰好一次：\n\n    - 主线程崩溃：BaseProcess._bootstrap 用裸 except 拦截 run() 抛出的异常后直接退出，\n      sys.excepthook 不会触发，头信息仅由下面的 except 分支打印；\n    - 子线程崩溃：异常不会传播到 run()，头信息仅由 install_excepthook\n      安装的 threading.excepthook 打印。\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def run(self) -> None:\n        install_excepthook()\n        try:\n            super().run()\n        except SystemExit:\n            raise\n        except BaseException:\n            print_crash_header()\n            raise\n\n\nclass SpawnProcessWithCrashHeader(_CrashHeaderProcessMixin, SpawnProcess):\n    pass\n\n\nclass ForkProcessWithCrashHeader(_CrashHeaderProcessMixin, ForkProcess):\n    pass\n"}
{"event": "snapshot", "time": 1793185438.0905018, "run_id": "eb67a89eef094083a110b35b721389a3", "seq": 3, "path": "deepinfer/environ.py", "content": "from __future__ import annotations\n\nimport os\nimport threading\nfrom collections.abc import Callable\nfrom datetime import timedelta\nfrom typing import Any\n\nDEFAULT_PREFILL_MAX_SUM_SEQLEN_K = 2**30\n\n\ndef _bool(v: str | None, default: str = \"0\") -> bool:\n    return (v if v is not None else default) not in (\"0\", \"\", \"false\", \"False\")\n\n\ndef _int(v: str | None, default: int = 0) -> int:\n    return int(v if v is not None else str(default))\n\n\ndef _float(v: str | None, default: float = 0.0) -> float:\n    return float(v if v is not None else str(default))\n\n\ndef _str(v: str | None, default: str = \"\") -> str:\n    return v if v is not None else default\n\n\n_descriptors: dict[str, EnvVar[Any]] = {}\n\n\nclass EnvVar[T]:\n    \"\"\"Non-data descriptor, resolved on first access\"\"\"\n\n    __slots__ = (\"name\", \"init\", \"lock\")\n\n    def __init__(self, init: Callable[[str | None], T]) -> None:\n        self.init = init\n        self.lock = threading.Lock()\n\n    def __set_name__(self, owner: type[envs], name: str) -> None:\n        self.name = name\n        _descriptors[name] = self\n\n    def __get__(self, instance: envs | None, owner: type[envs]) -> T:\n        with self.lock:\n            cached = owner.__dict__.get(self.name, self)\n            if cached is not self:\n                return cached\n            try:\n                value = self.init(os.getenv(self.name))\n            except Exception as e:  # noqa: BLE001\n                try:\n                    raise type(e)(f\"{self.name}: {e}\") from e\n                except TypeError:\n                    raise e from None\n            setattr(owner, self.name, value)\n            return value\n\n    # -- Factory Methods --\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def int(*, default: int = 0) -> EnvVar[int]:\n        return EnvVar(lambda v: _int(v, default))\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def float(*, default: float = 0.0) -> EnvVar[float]:\n        return EnvVar(lambda v: _float(v, default))\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def bool(*, default: bool = False) -> EnvVar[bool]:\n        return EnvVar(lambda v: _bool(v, \"1\" if default else \"0\"))\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def str(*, default: str = \"\") -> EnvVar[str]:\n        return EnvVar(lambda v: _str(v, default))\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def str_or_none() -> EnvVar[str | None]:\n        return EnvVar(lambda v: v)\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def int_or_none() -> EnvVar[int | None]:\n        return EnvVar(lambda v: int(v) if v is not None else None)\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def choice(*, default: str | None = None, choices: tuple[str, ...]) -> EnvVar[str | None]:\n        def _init(v: str | None) -> str | None:\n            if v is None:\n                return default\n            if v not in choices:\n                raise ValueError(f\"{v!r}, must be one of {choices}\")\n            return v\n\n        return EnvVar(_init)\n\n\nclass envs:\n    \"环境变量的集中定义模块\"\n\n    # -- Platform --\n    DEEPINFER_ACCELERATOR = EnvVar.str(default=\"nvidia\")\n\n    # -- Runtime --\n    DEEPINFER_COMPUTE_SUM_SMALLER_PROBS = EnvVar.bool()\n    DEEPINFER_JIT_CACHE_DIR = EnvVar.str_or_none()\n\n    # -- Distributed Communication --\n    DEEPINFER_NCCL_NUM_SMS = EnvVar.int(default=32)\n    DEEPINFER_USERBUFFER_COMM_SMS = EnvVar.int()\n    DEEPINFER_GLOO_TIMEOUT = EnvVar(lambda v: timedelta(seconds=_float(v, 14400)))\n    DEEPINFER_REARRANGE_P2P_GROUPS = EnvVar.int(default=1)\n\n    # -- MoE & Expert Parallelism --\n    DEEPINFER_OVERRIDE_NUM_EXTRA_EXPERTS = EnvVar.int()\n    DEEPINFER_EXPERT_COUNT_WINDOW_SIZE = EnvVar.int(default=100)\n    DEEPINFER_EXPERT_REARRANGEMENT_STEP_INTERVAL = EnvVar.int()\n    DEEPINFER_REARRANGE_AFTER_PREFILL_IN_NORMAL_ENGINE = EnvVar.bool()\n    DEEPINFER_MOE_LB_STAT_INTERVAL = EnvVar.int(default=128)\n    DEEPINFER_FORCE_IMBALANCE_RATIO = EnvVar.float()\n    DEEPINFER_FORCE_LOAD_BALANCE = EnvVar.bool()\n    DEEPINFER_SHOW_EPLB_DETAIL = EnvVar.bool()\n\n    # -- Attention --\n    DEEPINFER_PREFILL_MAX_SUM_SEQLEN_K = EnvVar.int_or_none()\n    \"未设置表示不限制 sum-K；传给 C++ Scheduler 时以 DEFAULT_PREFILL_MAX_SUM_SEQLEN_K 作为等效不限制的封顶值。\"\n    DEEPINFER_INDEX_ATTN_MEMORY_LIMIT = EnvVar.int(default=10 * 2**30)\n\n    # -- MTP --\n    DEEPINFER_USE_NEXTN_DECODE = EnvVar.int(default=5)\n    \"最大支持投机几个；默认 5，显式设为 0 可关闭投机解码\"\n    DEEPINFER_ENABLE_MTP_VARLEN = EnvVar.bool()\n    DEEPINFER_MAX_BACKTRACKING_TOKENS = EnvVar(lambda v: max(_int(v), envs.DEEPINFER_USE_NEXTN_DECODE + 1))\n\n    @EnvVar\n    def DEEPINFER_DFLASH_CONFIDENCE_HEAD_TEMPERATURE(v: str | None) -> float | tuple[float, ...]:\n        raw = v if v is not None else \"1.0\"\n        if \",\" in raw:\n            parts = [float(x.strip()) for x in raw.split(\",\")]\n            nextn = envs.DEEPINFER_USE_NEXTN_DECODE\n            if len(parts) != nextn:\n                raise ValueError(f\"has {len(parts)} elements ('{raw}') but DEEPINFER_USE_NEXTN_DECODE={nextn}\")\n            return tuple(parts)\n        return float(raw)\n\n    # -- Model Loading --\n    DEEPINFER_ENGRAM_PAD_TOKEN = EnvVar.int(default=2)\n    DEEPINFER_ENGRAM_FORCE_GPU_STORAGE = EnvVar(lambda v: _bool(v) or envs.DEEPINFER_ACCELERATOR == \"ascend\")\n\n    # -- Sampling --\n    DEEPINFER_SAMPLER_FORCE_TOPK = EnvVar.int()\n    DEEPINFER_DECODE_TOKEN_BLACKLIST = EnvVar.str()\n\n    # -- CUDA Graph --\n    DEEPINFER_ENFORCE_EAGER = EnvVar.bool()\n    DEEPINFER_CUDAGRAPH_BATCH_SIZE_INTERVAL = EnvVar.int(default=8)\n    DEEPINFER_DFLASH_ENFORCE_EAGER = EnvVar.bool()\n    DEEPINFER_DFLASH_CUDAGRAPH_BATCH_SIZE_INTERVAL = EnvVar.int(default=8)\n    DEEPINFER_DECODE_PERF_CACHE_DIR = EnvVar.str_or_none()\n    DEEPINFER_DECODE_PERF_CACHE_TTL_SEC = EnvVar.int(default=60 * 60)\n\n    # -- KV Cache Store --\n    DEEPINFER_NUM_STATE_SLOTS_RATIO = EnvVar.float(default=1.2)\n    DEEPINFER_PREFILL_STORE_EXTRA_STATE = EnvVar.bool()\n    DEEPINFER_PREFILL_STORE_EXTRA_SIZE = EnvVar.int(default=128)\n\n    # -- Structured Output --\n    DEEPINFER_XGRAMMAR_DEBUG = EnvVar.bool()\n    DEEPINFER_XGRAMMAR_TIMEOUT = EnvVar.int(default=20)\n    DEEPINFER_XGRAMMAR_DISABLE_CACHE = EnvVar.bool(default=False)\n    DEEPINFER_XGRAMMAR_CACHE_LIMIT_BYTES = EnvVar.int(default=10 * 1024 * 1024 * 1024)\n    DEEPINFER_SO_BUILDER_CPUS = EnvVar.int(default=4)\n\n    # -- Scheduling --\n    DEEPINFER_PREFILL_ATTEMPT_INTERVAL = EnvVar.int(default=70)\n    \"\"\"NORMAL 引擎 prefill 尝试间隔（ALL 点：全员有活才做，逻辑见 scheduler.hpp _schedule）。\n    各 rank 在集体 prefill 前累积待处理的 prompt。\"\"\"\n    DEEPINFER_PREFILL_ANY_ATTEMPT_INTERVAL = EnvVar.int(default=100)\n    \"ANY 保底间隔：任一 rank 有活就集体 prefill，孤立 rank 最多等这么多个 decode step\"\n    DEEPINFER_ZERO_OVERHEAD_SCHEDULING = EnvVar.bool()\n\n    # -- Logging --\n    DEEPINFER_LOGGING_INTERVAL_STEP = EnvVar.int(default=100)\n    DEEPINFER_NCCL_MEMORY_SAMPLE_INTERVAL_STEPS = EnvVar.int(default=1000)\n    DEEPINFER_RINGBUFFER_WARNING_INTERVAL = EnvVar.int(default=60)\n    DEEPINFER_GC_INTERVAL_STEP = EnvVar.int(default=1000)\n\n    # -- YoCo --\n    DEEPINFER_YOCO_PREFILL_TRUNCATION_MODE = EnvVar.choice(default=\"off\", choices=(\"off\", \"mask\", \"compact\"))\n    \"\"\"YoCo consumer prefill 截断模式：off 表示关闭；mask 保留全部 query，仅收窄 SWA\n    可见域；compact 真正移除截断区 query，以减少 consumer 层计算。\"\"\"\n    DEEPINFER_YOCO_PREFILL_KEEP_TOKENS = EnvVar.int()\n    \"\"\"YoCo consumer prefill 截断开启时保留的末尾 query token 数。mask 与 compact 的\n    SWA 可见域均为原始滑窗和末尾 KEEP_TOKENS 矩形的交集。必须满足 KEEP_TOKENS >=\n    window_size + DEEPINFER_MAX_BACKTRACKING_TOKENS；默认 0，启用截断时必须显式设置。\"\"\"\n\n    # -- Profiling & Debug --\n    DEEPINFER_BATCH_INVARIANT = EnvVar.bool()\n    DEEPINFER_DISABLE_SYNC_GUARD = EnvVar.bool()\n    \"debug 用：关闭 forbid_cuda_sync 守卫（model forward/sampling launch 期的 CPU-GPU 同步检查）\"\n    DEEPINFER_PROFILE_TORCH_CUDA_MEMORY = EnvVar.str_or_none()\n    DEEPINFER_ENABLE_MEMORY_TRACING = EnvVar.bool()\n    DEEPINFER_PROFILE_HTTP_ENABLE = EnvVar.bool()\n    DEEPINFER_PROFILE_HTTP_PORT_BASE = EnvVar.int(default=6070)\n    DEEPINFER_TORCH_PROFILER_DIR = EnvVar.str(default=\"/tmp\")\n\n    # -- Multi-Modal --\n    DEEPINFER_USE_MULTIMODAL_POOL = EnvVar.bool()\n    DEEPINFER_MULTIMODAL_POOL_SIZE_GB = EnvVar.int(default=8)\n    DEEPINFER_MULTI_MODAL_BUFFER_SIZE = EnvVar.int(default=512)\n    DEEPINFER_MULTI_MODAL_WORKER_TIMEOUT = EnvVar.float(default=1800.0)\n\n\ndef rearm(name: str) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Rearm specific descriptor, will resolve again on next access.\"\"\"\n    setattr(envs, name, _descriptors[name])\n\n\ndef rearm_all() -> None:\n    \"\"\"Rearm all descriptors.\"\"\"\n    for name, descriptor in _descriptors.items():\n        setattr(envs, name, descriptor)\n"}
{"event": "snapshot", "time": 1793185438.1233623, "run_id": "eb67a89eef094083a110b35b721389a3", "seq": 4, "path": "deepinfer/engine/stats_logger.py", "content": "\"\"\"Engine statistics collection, aggregation and logging.\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport queue\nimport statistics\nimport threading\nimport time\nimport traceback\nfrom collections import deque\nfrom collections.abc import Callable\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass, field\nfrom typing import TYPE_CHECKING\n\nimport numpy as np\nimport torch.distributed as dist\n\nfrom deepinfer import envs\nfrom deepinfer.engine.engine_type import EngineType\nfrom deepinfer.logger import init_logger\nfrom deepinfer.model_executor.parallel_utils.nccl_memory import NCCLMemoryStatsLogger\nfrom deepinfer.timer import cpu_timer, get_timers\nfrom deepinfer.utils import safe_divide\n\nif TYPE_CHECKING:\n    from deepinfer.config import CacheConfig, ModelConfig, ParallelConfig\n    from deepinfer.engine.llm_engine import LLMEngine\n\nlogger = init_logger(__name__)\n\n\n@dataclass\nclass StepStats:\n    \"\"\"Per-step statistics fed into :py:meth:`StatsLogger.log_step`.\"\"\"\n\n    prompt_run: bool\n    num_seqs: int\n    num_batched_tokens: int\n    sum_seqlen_qxk: int\n    max_seqlen_k: int\n    min_seqlen_k: int\n    attn_tflops: float\n    total_tflops: float  # Includes attn_tflops; feeds the MFU window directly.\n    first_token_latencies: np.ndarray\n    num_cached_tokens_gpu: int\n    num_generated_tokens: list[int] | None = None\n    num_verified_tokens: list[int] | None = None\n    batch_confidence_error: float = 0.0\n    moe_load_balance_ratio: tuple[float, float] | None = None\n\n\n@dataclass\nclass Aggregates:\n    \"\"\"Computed per-window / per-step values used for logging and reporting.\"\"\"\n\n    # throughput / steps\n    batch_pct: float = 0.0\n    cur_sps: float = 0.0\n    avg_sps: float = 0.0\n    cur_tps: float = 0.0\n    prompt_tps: float = 0.0\n    gen_tps: float = 0.0\n    total_prompt: int = 0\n    total_gen: int = 0\n    mfu: float = 0.0\n    # nextn / speculative\n    nextn_rate: float = 0.0\n    nextn_rates: list[float] = field(default_factory=list)\n    sum_accepted: list[int] = field(default_factory=list)\n    sum_batched: int = 0\n    sum_total: int = 0\n    avg_vlen: float = 0.0\n    avg_err: float = 0.0\n    # load balance\n    moe_lb: float = 0.0\n    # cache / scheduler\n    gpu_cache_usage: float = 0.0\n    gpu_state_usage: float = 0.0\n    num_runnings: int = 0\n    num_pendings: int = 0\n    num_chunked: int = 0\n    num_preempted: int = 0\n    num_aborted: int = 0\n    # latency / lengths\n    max_TTFT: float = 0.0\n    mean_TTFT: float = 0.0\n    avg_prompt_len: float = 0.0\n    avg_completion_len: float = 0.0\n    payload_len: float = 0.0\n\n\nclass Window:\n    \"\"\"Sliding window of ``(timestamp, payload, step)`` tuples.\"\"\"\n\n    __slots__ = (\"entries\",)\n\n    def __init__(self) -> None:\n        self.entries: list[tuple[float, object, int]] = []\n\n    def __len__(self) -> int:\n        return len(self.entries)\n\n    def __bool__(self) -> bool:\n        return bool(self.entries)\n\n    def append(self, now: float, payload: object, step: int) -> None:\n        self.entries.append((now, payload, step))\n\n    def trim(self, step: int, max_age: int) -> None:\n        self.entries = [e for e in self.entries if step - e[2] <= max_age]\n\n    def sum(self, key: Callable[[object], float]) -> float:\n        return sum(key(p) for _, p, _ in self.entries)\n\n\ndef _log_worker(q: queue.SimpleQueue[list[str] | None]) -> None:\n    need_sleep = True\n    for msgs in iter(q.get, None):\n        try:\n            if need_sleep:\n                time.sleep((dist.get_rank() % 8) * 0.005)\n            for m in msgs:\n                logger.info(m)\n            need_sleep = q.empty()  # we skip sleep when q has backlog\n        except Exception:\n            traceback.print_exc()\n\n\nclass StatsLogger:\n    \"\"\"Owns all sliding-window data, timing accumulators and logging state.\n\n    The ``engine`` back-reference is used as follows:\n\n    Read-only:\n      - ``scheduler`` (block counts, preempted/aborted, running/pending/chunked)\n      - ``state_manager`` (state cache usage)\n      - ``num_finished_completion``\n      - ``generate_step`` / ``step_start`` / ``last_step_interval``\n      - ``get_num_pendings()`` / ``build_extra_metrics_log()``\n\n    Mutated (kept on the engine for use by subclasses / other code):\n      - ``finished_payload`` — trimmed to the logging window each log step\n      - ``last_step_time`` — set to ``now`` at the end of every step\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(\n        self,\n        engine: LLMEngine,\n        *,\n        model_config: ModelConfig,\n        parallel_config: ParallelConfig,\n        cache_config: CacheConfig,\n        engine_type: EngineType,\n        tflops_limit: float,\n    ) -> None:\n        self._engine = engine\n\n        # read-only config refs\n        self._model_config = model_config\n        self._parallel_config = parallel_config\n        self._cache_config = cache_config\n        self._engine_type = engine_type\n        self._tflops_limit = tflops_limit\n\n        # sliding-window data (payload shape noted per window)\n        self._prompt_tokens = Window()  # payload: num_batched_tokens\n        self._generation_tokens = Window()  # payload: (gen_tokens, num_seqs, num_batched_tokens)\n        self._verified_tokens = Window()  # payload: num_verified_tokens | None\n        self._confidence_errors = Window()  # payload: batch_confidence_error\n        self._moe_lb = Window()  # payload: (avg_tokens, max_tokens)\n        self._tflops = Window()  # payload: tflops\n        self._windows = (\n            self._prompt_tokens,\n            self._generation_tokens,\n            self._verified_tokens,\n            self._confidence_errors,\n            self._moe_lb,\n            self._tflops,\n        )\n\n        # timing / counters\n        self._last_logging_time = 0.0\n        self._last_logging_step = -1\n        self._nccl_memory_logger = NCCLMemoryStatsLogger(engine)\n        self._log_queue: queue.SimpleQueue[list[str] | None] = queue.SimpleQueue()\n        self._log_worker_thread = threading.Thread(target=_log_worker, args=(self._log_queue,), daemon=True, name=\"stats_log_worker\")\n        self._log_worker_thread.start()\n        self._prefill_cached_tokens: deque[tuple[int, int]] = deque(maxlen=50)\n\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n    # window aggregation helpers\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def _throughput(window: Window, now: float, key: Callable[[object], float]) -> tuple[float, int]:\n        \"\"\"(tokens/s, total_tokens) over a window, ignoring the first sample.\"\"\"\n        if len(window) <= 1:\n            return 0.0, 0\n        total = sum(key(p) for _, p, _ in window.entries[1:])\n        # 口径：首条仅作窗口起点（值不计入），分母延伸到 now——含末样本之后的空窗，窗口停更时数值随时间衰减（对比 _mfu）\n        return total / (now - window.entries[0][0]), total\n\n    def _mfu(self, now: float) -> float:\n        entries = self._tflops.entries\n        if len(entries) <= 1:\n            return 0.0\n        # 口径：首条仅作区间起点（值不计入），分母为首尾样本间隔、不延伸到 now（对比 _throughput；_tflops 每步都追加，实际末样本时间戳即 now）\n        tflops_per_s = (sum(v for _, v, _ in entries) - entries[0][1]) / (entries[-1][0] - entries[0][0])\n        return tflops_per_s / self._parallel_config.model_parallel_size / self._tflops_limit\n\n    def _nextn_stats(self, agg: Aggregates) -> None:\n        \"\"\"Fill nextn accept rates / verified-len / confidence error in *agg*.\"\"\"\n        n = envs.DEEPINFER_USE_NEXTN_DECODE + 1\n        accepted = [0] * n\n        for _, (gen, _, _), _ in self._generation_tokens.entries:\n            for i, v in enumerate(gen):\n                accepted[i] += v\n        verified = [0] * n\n        for _, vt, _ in self._verified_tokens.entries:\n            if vt is not None:\n                for i, v in enumerate(vt):\n                    verified[i] += v\n\n        agg.sum_accepted = accepted\n        agg.sum_batched = self._generation_tokens.sum(lambda p: p[1])\n        agg.sum_total = self._generation_tokens.sum(lambda p: p[2])\n        if agg.sum_batched == 0 or n < 2:\n            return\n\n        agg.nextn_rates = [accepted[i] / verified[i] if verified[i] > 0 else 0.0 for i in range(1, n)]\n        agg.nextn_rate = sum(accepted[1:]) / (agg.sum_total - agg.sum_batched + 1e-15)\n        agg.avg_vlen = sum(verified[1:]) / agg.sum_batched\n\n        verified_count = agg.sum_total - agg.sum_batched\n        if verified_count > 0:\n            agg.avg_err = self._confidence_errors.sum(lambda e: e) / verified_count\n\n    def _moe_lb_ratio(self) -> float:\n        if not self._moe_lb:\n            return 1.0  # 无数据时默认完美均衡\n        return self._moe_lb.sum(lambda p: p[1]) / max(1, self._moe_lb.sum(lambda p: p[0]))\n\n    def _finished_payload_stats(self) -> tuple[float, float, float]:\n        \"\"\"(avg_prompt_len, avg_completion_len, payload_len)；payload 元组为 (num_finished, output_len, prompt_len, payload_len)。\"\"\"\n        fp = self._engine.finished_payload\n        num_finished = sum(p[0] for _, p, _ in fp)\n        if num_finished == 0:\n            return 0.0, 0.0, 0.0\n        completion = sum(p[1] for _, p, _ in fp)\n        prompt = sum(p[2] for _, p, _ in fp)\n        payload = sum(p[3] for _, p, _ in fp)\n        return prompt / num_finished, completion / num_finished, (payload / completion if completion > 0 else 0.0)\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def _merge_cuda_timers() -> tuple[dict, dict, dict, dict]:\n        \"\"\"把所有 cuda timer 合并为 (times, called, max_time, latest_times)。\"\"\"\n        times, called, max_time, latest = {}, {}, {}, {}\n        for lbl, tmr in get_timers():\n            if lbl.startswith(\"cuda\"):\n                for n, t in tmr.times.items():\n                    times[n] = times.get(n, 0.0) + t\n                    called[n] = called.get(n, 0) + tmr.called[n]\n                    max_time[n] = max(max_time.get(n, 0.0), tmr.max_time[n])\n                for n, t in tmr.latest_times.items():\n                    latest[n] = latest.get(n, 0.0) + t\n        return times, called, max_time, latest\n\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n    # logging\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n    def _build_log_messages(self, s: StepStats, a: Aggregates) -> list[str]:\n        \"\"\"Build log lines.\"\"\"\n        rank = dist.get_rank()\n        gpu_id = self._engine.driver_gpu_id\n        engine_t = cpu_timer.times.get(\"engine_step\", 1e9)\n        lines: list[str] = []\n\n        def _fmt(label: str, times: dict, called: dict, max_t: dict, lat: dict) -> None:\n            items = [\n                f\"{n} cur{1000 * lat.get(n, 0):.1f}ms/mean{1000 * t / called[n]:.1f}ms\"\n                f\"/max{1000 * max_t[n]:.1f}ms/{called[n]}calls/{100 * t / engine_t:.1f}%\"\n                for n, t in sorted(times.items(), key=lambda x: -x[1])\n                if n != \"engine_step\"\n            ]\n            if items:\n                lines.append(f\"RANK {rank}, GPU {gpu_id}, step {self._engine.generate_step}, [{label}] ({' | '.join(items)})\")\n\n        _fmt(\"cpu\", cpu_timer.times, cpu_timer.called, cpu_timer.max_time, cpu_timer.latest_times)\n        cuda_times, cuda_called, cuda_max, cuda_latest = self._merge_cuda_timers()\n        _fmt(\"cuda\", cuda_times, cuda_called, cuda_max, cuda_latest)\n\n        # prefill caching pct\n        total_calc = sum(calc for calc, _ in self._prefill_cached_tokens)\n        gpu_pct = sum(gpu for _, gpu in self._prefill_cached_tokens) / max(1, total_calc)\n\n        items = [\n            f\"is_prompt {s.prompt_run}\",\n            f\"cur_SPS {a.cur_sps:.3f}\",\n            f\"avg_SPS {a.avg_sps:.3f}\",\n            f\"cur_TPS {a.cur_tps:.1f}\",\n            f\"prompt_TPS {a.prompt_tps:.1f}\",\n            f\"completion_TPS {a.gen_tps:.1f}\",\n            f\"avg_nextn_accept_rate {a.nextn_rate * 100:.2f}%\",\n            f\"nextn_accept_rate [{', '.join(f'{r * 100:.2f}%' for r in a.nextn_rates)}]\",\n            f\"verified_tokens {a.sum_total - a.sum_batched}\",\n            f\"accepted_tokens {sum(a.sum_accepted[1:])}\",\n            f\"avg_verified_len {a.avg_vlen:.2f}\",\n            f\"avg_confidence_error {a.avg_err:.4f}\",\n            f\"moe_lb {a.moe_lb:.4f}\",\n        ]\n        items += [\n            f\"running {a.num_runnings}\",\n            f\"pending {a.num_pendings}\",\n            f\"chunked {a.num_chunked}\",\n            f\"num_batched_tokens {s.num_batched_tokens}[{a.batch_pct * 100:.2f}%]\",\n            f\"KV_cache_usage {a.gpu_cache_usage * 100:.2f}%\",\n        ]\n        if self._engine.state_manager is not None:\n            items.append(f\"state_cache_usage {a.gpu_state_usage * 100:.2f}%\")\n        if self._engine_type == EngineType.NORMAL:\n            prefill_t = cpu_timer.times.get(\"engine_step:prefill\", 0.0)\n            decode_t = cpu_timer.times.get(\"engine_step:decode\", 0.0)\n            total_t = prefill_t + decode_t\n            items.append(f\"prefill/decode {100 * safe_divide(prefill_t, total_t):.2f}%/{100 * safe_divide(decode_t, total_t):.2f}%\")\n        items += [\n            f\"prefill_caching_rate (GPU {gpu_pct * 100:.2f}%)\",\n            f\"TTFT (max {a.max_TTFT:.1f} ms, mean {a.mean_TTFT:.1f} ms)\",\n            f\"avg_length (input {a.avg_prompt_len:.1f}, output {a.avg_completion_len:.1f})\",\n            f\"finished {self._engine.num_finished_completion}\",\n            f\"preempted {a.num_preempted}\",\n            f\"aborted {a.num_aborted}\",\n            f\"sum_seqlen_qxk {s.sum_seqlen_qxk}\",\n            f\"max_seqlen_k {s.max_seqlen_k}\",\n            f\"min_seqlen_k {s.min_seqlen_k}\",\n            f\"attn_TFLOPs {s.attn_tflops:.1f}\",\n            f\"MFU {a.mfu:.3f}\",\n        ]\n        msg = f\"RANK {rank}, GPU {gpu_id}, step {self._engine.generate_step}, [stats] ({' | '.join(items)})\"\n        return [msg, *lines]\n\n    def _emit_logs(self, msgs: list[str]) -> None:\n        \"\"\"投递日志到固定 worker 线程，主线程不触碰 logger 的 handler 锁。\"\"\"\n        self._log_queue.put(msgs)\n\n    def close(self) -> None:\n        \"\"\"写完队列中已投递的日志后停掉 worker 线程；重复调用安全。\"\"\"\n        self._log_queue.put(None)\n        self._log_worker_thread.join()\n\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n    # record / aggregate steps\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n    def _record(self, s: StepStats, now: float, gen_tokens: list[int]) -> float:\n        \"\"\"Append per-step records and return batch utilization.\"\"\"\n        step = self._engine.generate_step\n\n        if s.prompt_run:\n            self._prompt_tokens.append(now, s.num_batched_tokens, step)\n            batch_pct = s.num_batched_tokens / self._model_config.max_num_batched_tokens\n            calc_tokens = s.num_batched_tokens + s.num_cached_tokens_gpu\n            if calc_tokens > 0:\n                cpu_timer.add_time(\"engine_step:prefill\", now - self._engine.last_step_time)\n                self._prefill_cached_tokens.append((calc_tokens, s.num_cached_tokens_gpu))\n        else:\n            self._generation_tokens.append(now, (gen_tokens, s.num_seqs, s.num_batched_tokens), step)\n            self._verified_tokens.append(now, s.num_verified_tokens, step)\n            self._confidence_errors.append(now, s.batch_confidence_error, step)\n            batch_pct = s.num_batched_tokens / (self._model_config.max_num_seqs * (1 + envs.DEEPINFER_USE_NEXTN_DECODE))\n            if s.num_seqs > 0:\n                cpu_timer.add_time(\"engine_step:decode\", now - self._engine.last_step_time)\n\n        self._tflops.append(now, s.total_tflops, step)\n\n        if s.moe_load_balance_ratio is not None and s.moe_load_balance_ratio[0] > 0:\n            self._moe_lb.append(now, s.moe_load_balance_ratio, step)\n\n        return batch_pct\n\n    def _should_log(self, s: StepStats) -> tuple[bool, int]:\n        \"\"\"Return (should_log, logging_interval).\"\"\"\n        step = self._engine.generate_step\n        interval = envs.DEEPINFER_LOGGING_INTERVAL_STEP\n        if interval <= 0:\n            return False, interval\n        if self._engine_type == EngineType.PROMPT:\n            interval = max(1, interval // 5)\n        should_log = step == 0 or step - self._last_logging_step >= interval\n        return should_log, interval\n\n    def _collect(self, s: StepStats, now: float, gen_tokens: list[int], should_log: bool, a: Aggregates) -> None:\n        \"\"\"Fill window + per-step aggregates into *a*; scheduler/TTFT/payload stats only on logging steps.\"\"\"\n        step = self._engine.generate_step\n        eng = self._engine\n\n        if should_log:\n            a.prompt_tps, a.total_prompt = self._throughput(self._prompt_tokens, now, lambda p: p)\n            a.gen_tps, a.total_gen = self._throughput(self._generation_tokens, now, lambda p: sum(p[0]))\n            a.mfu = self._mfu(now)\n            self._nextn_stats(a)\n            a.moe_lb = self._moe_lb_ratio()\n\n        # per-step (always)\n        step_dur = eng.last_step_interval if (envs.DEEPINFER_ZERO_OVERHEAD_SCHEDULING and step > 0) else now - eng.step_start\n        a.cur_sps = 1 / step_dur\n        a.avg_sps = 0.0 if self._last_logging_time == 0 else (step - self._last_logging_step) / (now - self._last_logging_time)\n        a.cur_tps = sum(gen_tokens) / step_dur\n\n        total_gpu = self._cache_config.num_gpu_blocks - 1\n        a.gpu_cache_usage = (total_gpu - eng.scheduler.get_num_free_gpu_blocks()) / total_gpu\n        if eng.state_manager is not None:\n            total_states = self._cache_config.num_state_seqs - 1\n            a.gpu_state_usage = (total_states - eng.state_manager.get_num_free_blocks()) / total_states\n\n        a.num_pendings = eng.get_num_pendings()\n        a.num_runnings, _ = eng.scheduler.get_sum_prompt_len_running()\n        a.num_chunked, _ = eng.scheduler.get_sum_prompt_len_chunked()\n\n        # expensive stats (only on logging steps)\n        if should_log:\n            a.num_preempted = eng.scheduler.get_num_preempted_seqs()\n            a.num_aborted = eng.scheduler.get_num_aborted_seqs()\n            a.max_TTFT = max(s.first_token_latencies, default=0)\n            a.mean_TTFT = statistics.mean(s.first_token_latencies) if len(s.first_token_latencies) > 0 else 0\n            a.avg_prompt_len, a.avg_completion_len, a.payload_len = self._finished_payload_stats()\n\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n    # main entry point\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n    def log_nccl_memory(self) -> None:\n        msg = self._nccl_memory_logger.step()\n        if msg:\n            self._emit_logs([msg])\n\n    @cpu_timer.record(\"log_stats\")\n    def log_step(self, s: StepStats) -> None:\n        \"\"\"Collect per-step stats; periodically log.\n\n        NOTE 假设这里面的操作是无副作用的，即在 should_log=False 时不调用也不影响正确性。\n        \"\"\"\n        now = time.perf_counter()\n        eng = self._engine\n        gen_tokens = s.num_generated_tokens if s.num_generated_tokens is not None else [s.num_batched_tokens]\n\n        # 1. record raw per-step data\n        a = Aggregates()\n        a.batch_pct = self._record(s, now, gen_tokens)\n\n        # 2. decide whether to log, then trim + aggregate\n        should_log, interval = self._should_log(s)\n        if should_log or interval <= 0:\n            base_age = max(0, interval)\n            for w in self._windows:\n                max_age = max(base_age, envs.DEEPINFER_MOE_LB_STAT_INTERVAL) if w is self._moe_lb else base_age\n                w.trim(eng.generate_step, max_age)\n            eng.finished_payload = [e for e in eng.finished_payload if eng.generate_step - e[2] <= base_age]\n        self._collect(s, now, gen_tokens, should_log, a)\n\n        # 3. log\n        if should_log:\n            msgs = self._build_log_messages(s, a)\n            extra = eng.build_extra_metrics_log()\n            if extra is not None:\n                msgs.append(extra)\n            self._emit_logs(msgs)\n\n        # 4. reset timers + bookkeeping\n        if should_log or interval <= 0:\n            for _, timer in get_timers():\n                timer.clear()\n            self._last_logging_time = now\n            self._last_logging_step = eng.generate_step\n        eng.last_step_time = now\n        for _, timer in get_timers():\n            timer.clear_latest()\n"}
